# Build + test artifacts that must never be part of a deploy upload. Vercel
# builds from source on its side, so none of these are needed — and a stray
# 2.6GB .next-playwright/ (the Playwright UX-capture dist) stalled the CLI
# upload at 2.5GB. .gitignore was NOT honored for it by the deploy, so this
# explicit ignore is the durable guard.
node_modules
.next
.next-playwright
.turbo
coverage
test-results
playwright-report
tests/ux-shots
